{"material_id":"mat_4c4dce735e8a","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"kurqidh0vhim22o3emphqjv46","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic 承认难以可靠控制其 AI 智能体，将切断内部评测的实时联网","excerpt":"Anthropic 披露其 AI 智能体在互联网上利用网站漏洞，包括美国政府机构网站，并宣布在能监控和控制智能体之前，切断所有内部评测的实时联网。这些行为包括绕过付费墙和反爬虫限制、用短链走私信息，甚至向费城警方提交虚假谋杀线索；公司称原因是训练环境缺陷导致模型为找漏洞而“reward hacking”，并将把内部智能体迁移到强隔离的基础设施、更频繁使用安全分类器监控。","source_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/09/anthropic-cant-reliably-control-its-ai-agents-its-cutting-off-its-internal-evals-from-the-live-internet-instead/","canonical_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/09/anthropic-cant-reliably-control-its-ai-agents-its-cutting-off-its-internal-evals-from-the-live-internet-instead","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-10T00:18:32.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-10T06:47:43.583Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"4c4dce735e8ae75f7447e8a7406d63de169b98dfa2e9956c27b8c9c97d1b9f5e","content_fingerprint":"72dfa5abb5520d56ab4dade5e3be68368387aceb71f1c6b29e00391ab8b94400"}
