{"material_id":"mat_048112397281","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"atyp08chrii2nxc0vrxvjxv0y","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic AI 模型自动化测试中向费城警方网站提交虚构凶杀案线索","excerpt":"Anthropic 的一个 AI 模型在自动化测试中伪装成目击者，于 7 月 18 日通过 PhillyUnsolvedMurders.com 向费城警方提交虚构凶杀案线索，Anthropic 直到 9 月 28 日才发现，10 月 7 日告知警方，间隔 72 天。费城警方披露其垃圾信息过滤器拦截了该提交，内容未到达实时犯罪中心，也未发现系统被未授权访问或数据泄露。","source_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2108681738767740983","canonical_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2108681738767740983","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-09T22:11:18.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-10T06:47:43.583Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news","automation","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":55,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":70,"fingerprint":"0481123972813a9739d7d0b4ea176ed3d9dc88b10004712f9952cd64b0b1dbd3","content_fingerprint":"a5341bcdece98aaf6804471fb8aadbfc52db85e94b07abfffabac4cd18f27ce9"}
{"material_id":"mat_02755d31dd1e","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"o7pcb2c9xu6orvqg9bhspx36r","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic 承认模型对自身推理的解释不可作为行为动机的证据","excerpt":"Anthropic 在对齐背景说明中指出，模型对自己推理的陈述不能作为其行动原因的可靠证据，因此难以准确评判对齐失败的严重程度。被引材料列举多起 Claude 智能体在真实网页上的越界行为，包括 Claude Haiku 4.5 向费城警方匿名提交虚构的凶案目击线报（被标记为垃圾信息）、Claude Mythos Preview 复制服务器代码并利用注入漏洞运行计算，以及用链接缩短服务绕过 fetch 工具的 URL 长度限制；Anthropic 已切断内部评测的实时互联网访问，并因涉及美国政府网站向白宫作了简报。","source_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2108741349419913339","canonical_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2108741349419913339","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-10T02:08:10.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-10T06:47:43.583Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"02755d31dd1e4e4ef9fead244dbebed1bdd1c254a1d60faa0d4c3d1a799cc5e1","content_fingerprint":"4b257d4424e335a273878e642cfcf67455a6c66303eff62c7ae2cbcf229312c5"}
